{
    "title": "Go Fly Drone Remote Controller",
    "description": "Elevate your Drone flying experience with Smart Flight for Fly Drone Camera, the ultimate companion app designed to empower your drone adventures. \r\n\r\n<b>Support 40+ Drone New Models (Android Mobile SDK 5.10)</b>\r\nGo Fly is the most trusted support app for Drone models such as: \r\n- Mini 3 / 3 Pro, RC N1, RC Plus / Pro, Mavic 3M, Mavic 3 Enterprise Series, Smart Controller Enterprise, Pilot 2 App, Assistant 2\r\n- Matrice 30 Series, Matrice 300 RTK (RC Plus or Smart Controller Ent), Matrice 350 RTK, D-RTK 2 Mobile Station for Matrice\r\n- Zenmuse H20 Series / H30 Series, Zenmuse P1 / L1 / L2\r\n\r\n<b>MAIN FEATURES</b>\r\nOffers intuitive controls, powerful features, and seamless connectivity to unlock the full potential of your Mini, Go 4, Fly,... through drone app:\r\n\r\n- Waypoint: Regardless of your skill level, Smart Flight for Fly Drone provides the most user-friendly yet robust tool for creating waypoint missions (compatible with Phantom series drones and others).\r\n\r\n- Panorama: Effortlessly capture 360-degree horizontal and vertical panoramas by drone mobile.\r\n\r\n- Focus mode: Go Fly for simplifies control by managing the drone's yaw axis and gimbal, allowing you to focus on horizontal movements.\r\n\r\n- Intelligent Flight Modes\r\n\r\n- User-friendly interface and expansive Camera View.\r\n\r\n- Simple exporting of images & videos to iPhone\r\n\r\n- On-screen Exposure Graph\r\n\r\n- Adjust Gimbal Directions\r\n\r\n- Accessible Flight Tutorials to assist you in getting started.\r\n\r\n*Compatible with almost model with Android Mobile SDK 5.10: Mini 3 Pro, RC Plus, Smart Controller Enterprise, Mini 3, RC N1, RC Pro, Mavic 3 Enterprise Series, Mavic 3M, Pilot 2 App, Assistant 2, Matrice 350 RTK, D-RTK 2 Mobile Station for Matrice, Zenmuse H20 Series, Zenmuse H30 Series, Zenmuse P1, Zenmuse L1, Zenmuse L2, Matrice 300 RTK (DJI RC Plus), Matrice 300 RTK (DJI Smart Controller Ent), Matrice 30 Series, Zenmuse H30\r\n\r\nWith Mavic models, there are some features our app hasn't supported yet: Low Battery Warning, Critical Low Battery Warning, Time to Discharge, Lock Gimbal When Shooting, Sync Gimbal with Aircraft Heading, Gimbal Mode. Preview media, Play media, On/Off Head LEDs & Camera Forward/Down.\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER:\r\nThis app is neither an official DJI product nor affiliated with the DJI company.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Elevate your Drone flying experience with Smart Flight for Fly Drone Camera, the ultimate companion app designed to empower your drone adventures. <br><br><b>Support 40+ Drone New Models (Android Mobile SDK 5.10)</b><br>Go Fly is the most trusted support app for Drone models such as: <br>- Mini 3 / 3 Pro, RC N1, RC Plus / Pro, Mavic 3M, Mavic 3 Enterprise Series, Smart Controller Enterprise, Pilot 2 App, Assistant 2<br>- Matrice 30 Series, Matrice 300 RTK (RC Plus or Smart Controller Ent), Matrice 350 RTK, D-RTK 2 Mobile Station for Matrice<br>- Zenmuse H20 Series / H30 Series, Zenmuse P1 / L1 / L2<br><br><b>MAIN FEATURES</b><br>Offers intuitive controls, powerful features, and seamless connectivity to unlock the full potential of your Mini, Go 4, Fly,... through drone app:<br><br>- Waypoint: Regardless of your skill level, Smart Flight for Fly Drone provides the most user-friendly yet robust tool for creating waypoint missions (compatible with Phantom series drones and others).<br><br>- Panorama: Effortlessly capture 360-degree horizontal and vertical panoramas by drone mobile.<br><br>- Focus mode: Go Fly for simplifies control by managing the drone&#39;s yaw axis and gimbal, allowing you to focus on horizontal movements.<br><br>- Intelligent Flight Modes<br><br>- User-friendly interface and expansive Camera View.<br><br>- Simple exporting of images &amp; videos to iPhone<br><br>- On-screen Exposure Graph<br><br>- Adjust Gimbal Directions<br><br>- Accessible Flight Tutorials to assist you in getting started.<br><br>*Compatible with almost model with Android Mobile SDK 5.10: Mini 3 Pro, RC Plus, Smart Controller Enterprise, Mini 3, RC N1, RC Pro, Mavic 3 Enterprise Series, Mavic 3M, Pilot 2 App, Assistant 2, Matrice 350 RTK, D-RTK 2 Mobile Station for Matrice, Zenmuse H20 Series, Zenmuse H30 Series, Zenmuse P1, Zenmuse L1, Zenmuse L2, Matrice 300 RTK (DJI RC Plus), Matrice 300 RTK (DJI Smart Controller Ent), Matrice 30 Series, Zenmuse H30<br><br>With Mavic models, there are some features our app hasn&#39;t supported yet: Low Battery Warning, Critical Low Battery Warning, Time to Discharge, Lock Gimbal When Shooting, Sync Gimbal with Aircraft Heading, Gimbal Mode. Preview media, Play media, On/Off Head LEDs &amp; Camera Forward/Down.<br><br>DISCLAIMER:<br>This app is neither an official DJI product nor affiliated with the DJI company.",
